flowchart LR
  Chat[Existing Fred chat and evidence loop] --> Router[Model profile router]
  Router -->|gpt-6-astra| Adapter[Responses adapter: low reasoning, store false]
  Router -->|Other profiles| Existing[Existing provider API]
  Adapter --> API[OpenAI Responses]
  API -->|incomplete: max_messages only| Retry[Discard interrupted output; retry once with serial calls]
  Retry --> API
  API -->|Still incomplete or failed| Error[Return error; never execute partial tool calls]
  API --> Results[Text and function calls]
  Results --> Chat
  Chat --> Handlers[Existing authorized tool handlers]
  Handlers -->|Tool results and retained reasoning| Adapter
